  "notes": "B.S. in Business Administration, Management major, College of Business. SEMESTER SYSTEM — all credits are semester hours. Built from the official MSU Denver BSBA Planning Guide & Checklist (https://www.msudenver.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/BSBA-Planning-Guide_Checklist-23-24.pdf). Structure: General Studies 34cr (ENG 1010/1020, COMM 1010/1100, MTH 1310, Arts & Humanities 6cr, Historical 3cr, Natural & Physical Sciences 6cr, ECO 2010/2020 for Social & Behavioral Sciences), Business Core 36cr (BUS 1850/1950, ACC 2010/2020, CIS 2010/3300/3320, FIN 3300, MGT 2210/3000, MKT 3000, MGT 4950 Senior Experience), Additional College of Business 6cr (MTH 1320, BUS 3040), Major 24cr (21cr upper-division MGT electives + MGT 4910 Strategic Leadership in final semester), General Electives 20cr. C or better required in business core; 40 upper-division hours required. 120 semester credits total.",
